+
+All wire values are below 54,739 bytes and every unlocking bytecode is below
+10,000 bytes. Standardness is a relay-VM evaluation using
+`createVirtualMachineBch2026(true)`, not the normal non-standard VM. Its
+largest observed cost was 7,229,670 (v0 deposit terminal); all standard-VM
+evaluations accepted.
